                                                      <h1 class="MarginTop10Element Text4XLElement FontBoldElement TrackingTightElement TextGray900Element SmallText6XLElement">A thoughtful approach to interior design</h1>
                                                      <p class="MarginTop6Element TextLargeElement Leading8Element TextGray600Element">
                                                            Blueprint Living explores how a home can feel considered, comfortable and distinctly personal. Interior design begins with understanding the people who use a space: their routines, priorities, existing belongings and hopes for each room. From there, a clear visual direction can bring together layout, colour, lighting, textures and furniture without losing sight of everyday practicality. The aim is not to impose one signature look, but
                                                            to shape a connected home where individual choices work well together. Whether you are gathering ideas or refining a particular room, this is a place to think carefully about what you want your surroundings to express. Project scope, availability and any specific design services should be discussed directly with Blueprint Living.
                                                      </p>
                                                      <div class="MarginTop10Element FlexElement ItemsCenterElement GapX6Element">
                                                            <a href="#" class="RoundedFullElement bg--600 PaddingX3Point5Element PaddingY2Point5Element TextSmallElement FontSemiBoldElement TextWhiteElement ShadowSmallElement hover:bg--500 FocusVisibleOutlineElement FocusVisibleOutline2Element FocusVisibleOutlineOffset2Element focus-visible:outline--600"></a>
                                                      </div>
                                                </div>
                                          </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="MarginTop20Element SmallMarginTop24Element MediumMarginXAutoElement MediumMaxWidth2XL LargeMarginXZeroElement LargeMarginTopZeroElement LargeWidthScreenElement">
                                          <div class="ShadowLargeElement MediumRounded3XLElement">
